lead: A self-hosted sign-in server. Your apps offer passwordless sign-in through one OpenID Connect issuer: a passkey, or an account people already have at Discord, GitHub, Google, Apple, Microsoft, any OpenID Connect provider, a Mastodon-compatible server or Bluesky.
